WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.272
Today is the final check. It takes about four minutes.

2
00:00:03.722 --> 00:00:07.144
Your child writes on their page. You have the grown-up page.

3
00:00:07.594 --> 00:00:12.044
It is the same sample as day one. Their name, and the same ten letters.

4
00:00:12.494 --> 00:00:19.173
Then there are six new words. Your child has never written them in this book, so they show what the hand does without help.

5
00:00:19.623 --> 00:00:23.830
Do not help today. Watch the pencil, the same way you did on day one.

6
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.668
Mark a new word if you can read it, and its letters started in the right place.

7
00:00:29.118 --> 00:00:35.582
Write the four numbers on your page. Then put the two pages from day one beside the two pages from today.

8
00:00:36.032 --> 00:00:40.178
That is your proof, on paper. Show your child the pages side by side.

9
00:00:40.778 --> 00:00:44.975
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

10
00:00:45.425 --> 00:00:53.495
If nothing has changed, the plan says to slow down. And if writing hurts or the hand tires fast, tell the teacher what you saw.

11
00:00:53.945 --> 00:00:58.614
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
